<td id="A3.T3.4.1.1.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_tt" colspan="4">Sample variance (<math id="A3.T3.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\times 10^{-4}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\times 10^{-4}</annotation></semantics></math>)</td></tr>
